# Frontend

- Use Angular strict mode, typed API clients and accessible semantic components.
- Meet WCAG 2.2 AA for navigation, contrast, focus and labels.
- Distinguish potential, finding, assessed credit and recovered value visually.
- Never expose restricted fields based only on hidden UI elements; API authorization is authoritative.
- Provide loading, empty, partial-data and error states.
- Display data freshness, source and methodology near fiscal metrics.

